{
  "title": "EEGManyLabs Eimer1996 Resting State",
  "description": "This dataset contains raw EEG resting-state recordings (eyes open and eyes closed) in BIDS format. These data were collected from 166 healthy adult participants as part of an EEGManyLabs replication of Eimer (1996), prior to the main replication task. Recordings were collected across multiple sites and differ in sampling rates, channel layouts, and recording references.",
